    "description": "Added Slack integration to the Salesloft app. This would allow customers to opt into receiving additional notifications regarding upcoming tasks and meetings through Slack as well as through the app.\nOne complaint from customers was that their task notifications where not noisy or sticky enough. By enabling Slack notifications, they would be notified outside of the webpage and the messages would stay visible to them.\nTo do this, I used a pre-existing method that retrieved tasks due every couple of minutes. I created a separate notification settings model tied to a users account that would store if they had enabled Slack notifications. I created a new class to handle message formatting and sending using the Slack API. This was then tested in a QA environment by creating a dummy task and user and verifying that the Slack bot would send a message updated with the tasks details to the user.",
